  "body": "<p class=\"reference\" data-aid=\"170145856\" id=\"p_mUqSr\">‘21–27 juni. “Hij is opgewekt”: Mattheüs 28; Markus 16; Lukas 24; Johannes 20–21’, <cite>Kom dan en volg Mij – voor thuis en in de kerk: Nieuwe Testament 2027</cite> (2027)</p>\n<p class=\"short-reference\" data-aid=\"170145871\" id=\"p_lHrOm\">‘21–27 juni. “Hij is opgewekt”’, <cite>Kom dan en volg Mij: 2027</cite></p>\n<header>\n<img alt=\"het lege graf\" id=\"img_bTGtn\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21100%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"yjwukwvc340kgl61aaeb4cjdpcxhworf3xj2g913\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"56\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7857142857142858\" data-public-title=\"Garden Tomb\" data-public-description=\"Jesus Christ's empty tomb - set at Goshen, Utah\"/>\n<p class=\"title-number\" data-aid=\"170145899\" id=\"p_grLFh\">21–27 juni: ‘Hij is opgewekt’</p>\n<h1 data-aid=\"170145915\" id=\"p_aBGUE\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html\">Mattheüs 28</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html\">Markus 16</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html\">Lukas 24</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html\">Johannes 20–21</span></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<p data-aid=\"170145930\" id=\"p_qJCBv\">De dood van Jezus van Nazareth kan voor veel waarnemers een ironisch einde van een opmerkelijk leven hebben geleken. Was dit niet de man die Lazarus uit de dood had opgewekt? Had Hij de moorddadige dreigementen van de Farizeeën niet keer op keer weerstaan? Hij had de macht om blindheid, melaatsheid en allerlei ziekten te genezen. De wind en de zee gehoorzaamden Hem. Toch hing Hij daar aan een kruis en verklaarde: ‘Het is volbracht’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/19.html?id=p30#p30\">Johannes 19:30</span>). Er klonk misschien wel oprechte verrassing door in de honende woorden: ‘Anderen heeft Hij verlost, Zichzelf kan Hij niet verlossen’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/27.html?id=p42#p42\">Mattheüs 27:42</span>). Maar we weten dat Jezus’ dood niet het einde van het verhaal was. De stilte van het graf was tijdelijk. Het heilswerk van Christus was nog maar net begonnen. ‘Hij is opgewekt’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html?id=p6#p6\">Markus 16:6</span>), en zijn leringen zijn niet het zwijgen opgelegd, want zijn discipelen prediken het evangelie aan ‘al de volken’ met vertrouwen op zijn belofte dat Hij altijd met ons is, ‘tot de voleinding van de wereld’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html?id=p19-p20#p19\">Mattheüs 28:19–20</span>).</p>\n<section id=\"sec_tynd9\">\n<header>\n<img alt=\"studiepictogram\" class=\"icon\" id=\"img_xNZtj\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21100%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"df7bc1f3168311edaa54eeeeac1e79ae7f612244\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"100\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.0\" data-public-title=\"Integrated Curriculum Illustration\" data-public-description=\"Illustration of a Journal (Personal Study)\"/>\n<h2 data-aid=\"170145944\" id=\"p_hI0bP\">Studietips voor thuis en in de kerk</h2>\n</header>\n<section id=\"sec_iXBs6\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170145960\" id=\"p_ujbmE\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html\">Mattheüs 28</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html\">Markus 16</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html\">Lukas 24</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html\">Johannes 20</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170145975\" id=\"p_nPf1A\">Omdat Jezus is opgestaan, zal iedereen weer leven.</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170145990\" id=\"p_ylG0n\">Deze passages beschrijven een van de belangrijkste gebeurtenissen in de geschiedenis van de mensheid: de opstanding van Jezus Christus. Stel jezelf tijdens het lezen in de plaats van de mensen die getuige van deze gebeurtenis waren. Als je de kans had om met deze getuigen te praten, wat zou je ze dan vragen? Wat denk je dat ze je over de Heiland zouden vertellen?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146006\" id=\"p_eb0Mk\">Bedenk hoe de opstanding van de Heiland jou heeft beïnvloed – je kijk op het leven, je relaties en je geloof in Christus en zijn evangelie.</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146022\" id=\"p_icbcv\">Vóór de opstanding van Jezus had niemand ooit een herrezen persoon gezien. Misschien begrepen ze niet helemaal wat een opstanding inhoudt. Wat leer je bijvoorbeeld uit <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p36-p43#p36\">Lukas 24:36–43</span> en <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html\">Johannes 20</span> over de opstanding? Wat is het verschil met uit de dood opgewekt worden, zoals Lazarus? (Zie <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/11.html\">Johannes 11</span>.)</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146042\" id=\"p_cGLaS\">Zie ook Reyna I. Aburto, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2021/04/42aburto?lang=nld\">Het graf kent geen overwinning</a>’, <cite>Liahona</cite>, mei 2021, 85–86; ‘Jesus Is Resurrected’, ‘The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles’ (video’s), Gospel Library; Onderwerpen en vragen, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/gospel-topics/resurrection-study-guide?lang=nld\">Opstanding</a>’, Evangeliebibliotheek.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure8\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/377751db1c07c5bb5c9d81a426154bf3056b3258/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/377751db1c07c5bb5c9d81a426154bf3056b3258/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Jesus Is Resurrected\" data-video-description=\"Peter and John find the empty tomb. Jesus, now resurrected, appears to Mary.\" data-video-id=\"6380848654112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"255000\" data-assetId=\"37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2\" data-ref-id=\"37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2\" data-duration-string=\"4:15\" id=\"video1\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380848654112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"83116814\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"18686425\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"33048752\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/37e87b5dbe0cbe5e5543acb4d28eeff59fa069f2-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"83116814\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Jesus Is Resurrected</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure9\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2f0773a916051f443d7f448bcca971584c886e11/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2f0773a916051f443d7f448bcca971584c886e11/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles\" data-video-description=\"The resurrected Christ appears to the Apostles and tells them, “Peace be unto you.” They touch His hands and feet and He eats with them. He tells them He will send them as His Father sent Him. Luke 24:36–41, 44–49; John 20:21\" data-video-id=\"6380853374112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"141683\" data-assetId=\"597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363\" data-ref-id=\"597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363\" data-duration-string=\"2:21\" id=\"video2\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380853374112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"59065080\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"9763067\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"19808209\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/597068e271137f0d4a0620c9cb1670e70d03c363-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"59065080\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">The Risen Lord Appears to the Apostles</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_wC52g\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146058\" id=\"p_ppIQr\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p35#p13\">Lukas 24:13–35</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146073\" id=\"p_ytJHA\">Ik kan de Heiland vragen ‘bij [mij] te blijven’.</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170146088\" id=\"p_x7QVG\">Je kunt het verhaal in <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p35#p13\">Lukas 24:13–35</span> als volgt bestuderen: teken een weg en noteer aan de ene kant enkele details uit het verhaal die je belangrijk vindt. Schrijf aan de andere kant parallellen met je eigen ervaring als volgeling van Jezus Christus. Bijvoorbeeld:</p>\n<table class=\"vertical-axis\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146143\" id=\"p_axYUG\"><i>Jezus kwam bij hen en liep met hen mee (zie <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p15#p15\">Lukas 24:15</span>).</i></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146158\" id=\"p_oVlak\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146174\" id=\"p_rJmBd\"><i>Jezus wil met mij wandelen.</i></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146190\" id=\"p_tgpe4\"><i>‘Hun ogen werden gesloten gehouden’ (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p16#p16\">vers 16</span>)</i></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146206\" id=\"p_vtlJq\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146222\" id=\"p_hXnIn\"><i>Soms herken ik de aanwezigheid van de Heer niet.</i></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146238\" id=\"p_mrkHk\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146256\" id=\"p_uOMSE\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146269\" id=\"p_yxNAL\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146285\" id=\"p_j5plu\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146302\" id=\"p_pSBx1\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146317\" id=\"p_amoRi\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146095\" id=\"p_tgCoY\">De twee discipelen</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146328\" id=\"p_v3jrW\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146111\" id=\"p_wszdN\">De weg naar Emmaüs</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146350\" id=\"p_bdCS8\"></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><div class=\"card-label\">\n<p class=\"label\" data-aid=\"170146127\" id=\"p_bhFTh\">Ik</p>\n</div>\n<p data-aid=\"170146365\" id=\"p_s81Vp\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-aid=\"170146379\" id=\"p_lFaN9\">Hoe wandelt de Heiland met jou? Hoe nodig je Hem uit om bij je te blijven?</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146394\" id=\"p_oFB2e\">Zie ook <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/6?lang=nld&amp;id=p34#p34\">Mozes 6:34</a>; Henry B. Eyring, ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2025/04/18eyring?lang=nld\">Nader tot Mij</a>’, <cite>Liahona</cite>, mei 2025, 24–28; ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/hymns/abide-with-me?lang=nld\">Blijf bij mij, Heer</a>’, <cite>Lofzangen</cite>, nr. 112; ‘Christ Appears on the Road to Emmaus’ (video), Gospel Library.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure10\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/ad6b0642fa657694d684a5eba0e306e561dce318/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/ad6b0642fa657694d684a5eba0e306e561dce318/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Christ Appears on the Road to Emmaus\" data-video-description=\"The resurrected Christ walks with two men on the road to Emmaus. He blesses and breaks bread with them and then vanishes from sight. Their hearts burned within them. Luke 24:13–33\" data-video-id=\"6380852019112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"214214\" data-assetId=\"82d1b292db1d6e6b65b0c1a698e604c3d7de7d9f\" data-ref-id=\"82d1b292db1d6e6b65b0c1a698e604c3d7de7d9f\" data-duration-string=\"3:34\" id=\"video3\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380852019112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"98119730\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/82d1b292db1d6e6b65b0c1a698e604c3d7de7d9f-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"24778314\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/82d1b292db1d6e6b65b0c1a698e604c3d7de7d9f-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"43632755\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/82d1b292db1d6e6b65b0c1a698e604c3d7de7d9f-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"98119730\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Christ Appears on the Road to Emmaus</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_v9YPW\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146411\" id=\"p_ucSSf\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p19-p29#p19\">Johannes 20:19–29</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146426\" id=\"p_t0O2p\">‘Zalig zijn zij die niet gezien zullen hebben en toch zullen geloven.’</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146440\" id=\"p_uLNcI\">Waarom kan geloven zonder te zien volgens jou een zegen zijn? (Zie <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p29#p29\">Johannes 20:29</span>.) Bedenk hoe je bent gezegend door in dingen te geloven die je niet kon zien.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146455\" id=\"p_yooup\">Wat vraagt God je te geloven zonder te zien? Wat helpt je om in die situaties geloof te hebben?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170146472\" id=\"p_cpi6c\">Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/11.html?id=p16#p16\">Johannes 11:16</span>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/32?lang=nld&amp;id=p16-p21#p16\">Alma 32:16–21</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/12?lang=nld&amp;id=p6#p6\">Ether 12:6</a>; ‘Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed’ (video), Gospel Library.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure11\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/611175feaa47716aa03b165aa7fc9d7935a6a5ba/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/611175feaa47716aa03b165aa7fc9d7935a6a5ba/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed\" data-video-description=\"Thomas, one of the Twelve, doubts the appearance of the risen Lord. Christ appears and tells him, “Blessed are those who have not seen, and yet have believed.” John 20:24–29\" data-video-id=\"6380852609112\" data-ip=\"Download &amp; Streaming\" data-duration=\"147000\" data-assetId=\"a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1\" data-ref-id=\"a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1\" data-duration-string=\"2:27\" id=\"video4\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380852609112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"52241174\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"9311793\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"18576292\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/a5413e7e60dc26f22125d3021d85f47166aac2a1-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"52241174\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Blessed Are They That Have Not Seen, and Yet Have Believed</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_gyV0D\">\n<img alt=\"Christus met discipelen aan de oever van de zee\" id=\"img_sQ9Zg\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21500%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"2872b289f10511eebdc3eeeeac1ef57857ac682f\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"281\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7793594306049823\" data-public-title=\"Feed My Sheep\" data-public-description=\"The resurrected Jesus Christ appearing to seven of the apostles (including Peter) on the shores of the Sea of Galilee. Peter is standing by Christ. Christ has His hand on Peter's shoulder as He instructs Peter to &quot;feed my sheep.&quot; The other apostles are seated on the ground as they watch. There is a fishing boat in the background.\"/>\n<figcaption>\n<p data-aid=\"170146488\" id=\"p_pzEbY\"><cite>Weid mijn schapen</cite>, Kamille Corry</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_nAXYl\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146506\" id=\"p_oY7v9\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/21.html?id=p1-p17#p1\">Johannes 21:1–17</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146525\" id=\"p_oj2qP\">De Heiland nodigt mij uit om zijn schapen te weiden.</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170146543\" id=\"p_fdRzV\">Bedenk hoe <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/21.html?id=p15-p17#p15\">Johannes 21:15–17</span> op jou van toepassing kan zijn. Je kunt bijvoorbeeld Simons naam vervangen door de jouwe, en ‘Mijn lammeren’ en ‘Mijn schapen’ door de namen van mensen die de Heer je vraagt te dienen – mensen die je bedient, buren, familieleden enzovoort.</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146560\" id=\"p_dLuVd\">Je kunt ook de inzichten van president Jeffrey R. Holland over dit verhaal bestuderen in ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2012/10/the-first-great-commandment?lang=nld\">Het eerste grote gebod</a>’ (<cite>Liahona</cite>, november 2012, 83–85).</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146581\" id=\"p_cqljU\">Zie ook <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/5.html?id=p1-p11#p1\">Lukas 5:1–11</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/1-pet/5.html?id=p2-p4,p8#p2\">1 Petrus 5:2–4, 8</span>; ‘Feed My Sheep’ (video), Gospel Library.</p>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure12\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/016522caa36c3ee01e293a879c307b8830f4a5a1/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/016522caa36c3ee01e293a879c307b8830f4a5a1/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"Feed My Sheep\" data-video-description=\"Jesus shows Himself to His disciples and implores Peter to feed His sheep. John 21:1–22\" data-video-id=\"6380855388112\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"347000\" data-assetId=\"61a33a8727608dbe07a8a0f798d958d07d42e42a\" data-ref-id=\"61a33a8727608dbe07a8a0f798d958d07d42e42a\" data-duration-string=\"5:47\" id=\"video5\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/6380855388112.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"138896623\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/61a33a8727608dbe07a8a0f798d958d07d42e42a-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"37400393\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/61a33a8727608dbe07a8a0f798d958d07d42e42a-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"62838239\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/61a33a8727608dbe07a8a0f798d958d07d42e42a-1080p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-file-size=\"138896623\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">Feed My Sheep</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"for-teacher\" data-purpose=\"teaching-improvement\" id=\"fig_gF086\">\n<p data-aid=\"170146598\" id=\"p_jFout\"><strong>Pas de activiteiten aan.</strong> Als je meer activiteiten zoekt voor onderwijs aan jongeren of volwassenen, kun je de activiteiten in ‘Ideeën voor onderwijs aan kinderen’ vaak aan leerlingen van alle leeftijden aanpassen.</p>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_rBeb0\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146613\" id=\"p_zXATW\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html?id=p16-p20#p16\">Mattheüs 28:16–20</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html?id=p14-p20#p14\">Markus 16:14–20</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p44-p53#p44\">Lukas 24:44–53</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146632\" id=\"p_qH7r0\">‘U bent van deze dingen getuigen.’</h3>\n</header>\n<p data-aid=\"170146651\" id=\"p_hyh04\">Bedenk hoe jij kunt helpen met het werk dat Jezus in deze verzen aan zijn apostelen gaf. Van welke ‘dingen’ kun jij getuigen? (<span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p48#p48\">Lukas 24:48</span>.) Wie kun jij over je getuigenis vertellen? Je kunt ook manieren bedenken om je bereik via sociale media en andere middelen te vergroten. Hoe werkt de Heer met je mee door zijn woord te bevestigen? (Zie <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html?id=p20#p20\">Markus 16:20</span>.)</p>\n<p data-aid=\"170146670\" id=\"p_rSvWi\">Zie ook ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/the-living-christ-the-testimony-of-the-apostles/the-living-christ-the-testimony-of-the-apostles?lang=nld\">De levende Christus: het getuigenis van de apostelen</a>’, Evangeliebibliotheek.</p>\n<figure class=\"for-teacher\" data-purpose=\"teaching-improvement\" id=\"fig_yNhB2\">\n<p data-aid=\"170146688\" id=\"p_juYtI\">Zie voor meer ideeën de <a href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/study/magazines/liahona\"><cite>Liahona</cite></a> en <a href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/study/magazines/for-the-strength-of-youth\"><cite>Voor de kracht van de jeugd</cite></a> van deze maand.</p>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_zu9pO\">\n<header>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146706\" id=\"p_l7I01\">Hulp bij de Schriften</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"no-marker\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146725\" id=\"p_azvLr\"><span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/27-matthew-28-mark-16-luke-24-john-20-21.html?id=p_c9MfW-p_ptNy6#p_c9MfW\">Waarom zei Jezus tegen Maria Magdalena: ‘Houd Mij niet vast’?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146745\" id=\"p_a2YwJ\"><span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/27-matthew-28-mark-16-luke-24-john-20-21.html?id=p_zkASe-p_dQJDz#p_zkASe\">Waarom ‘blies’ Jezus op zijn discipelen?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146764\" id=\"p_qG4du\"><span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/27-matthew-28-mark-16-luke-24-john-20-21.html?id=p_oxBY6-p_qxPIy#p_oxBY6\">Wat weten we over Petrus’ dood?</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-aid=\"170146783\" id=\"p_pV0ll\"><span class=\"legacy-cross-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../manual/scripture-helps-new-testament/27-matthew-28-mark-16-luke-24-john-20-21.html\">Klik hier voor meer.</span></p>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_iU1pA\">\n<header>\n<img alt=\"pictogram kinderen onderwijzen\" class=\"icon\" id=\"img_q02bF\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21100%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"1a99f017c4ee11ed9c00eeeeac1e6838b05c8916\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"100\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.0\" data-public-title=\"Come Follow Me Doctrine &amp; Covenants 2025\" data-public-description=\"Father and son reading a book\"/>\n<h2 data-aid=\"170146801\" id=\"p_qcL8z\">Ideeën voor onderwijs aan kinderen</h2>\n</header>\n<section id=\"sec_zsGaJ\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146819\" id=\"p_dKub2\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/28.html\">Mattheüs 28</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/mark/16.html\">Markus 16</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html\">Lukas 24</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p1-p23#p1\">Johannes 20:1–23</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146836\" id=\"p_cPvkF\">Omdat Jezus is opgestaan, zal ik ook uit de dood opstaan.</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146853\" id=\"p_pp2SD\">Jullie kunnen ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/46-he-is-risen?lang=nld\">He Is Risen</a>’ [Hij is opgestaan] (in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament]) bespreken en af en toe stoppen om je kinderen te vragen hoe ze zich zouden voelen als ze Maria, Thomas of de andere discipelen waren. Ze kunnen ook ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/childrens-songbook/did-jesus-really-live-again?lang=nld\">Is Jezus werk’lijk opgestaan?</a>’ (<cite>Kinderliedjes</cite>, p. 45) zingen en zinsneden uit het liedje met zinsneden in <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p35-p43#p35\">Lukas 24:35–43</span> verbinden.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146869\" id=\"p_tqo5K\">Jullie kunnen ook met elkaar bespreken waarom kennis van Jezus’ opstanding jullie blij maakt.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"video\" id=\"figure13\"><video preload=\"none\" controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/8967F36357D5BD4928A73749408982CC1481B1E8/full/%21768%2C/0/default\" thumbnail=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/8967F36357D5BD4928A73749408982CC1481B1E8/full/%21192%2C/0/default\" data-video-title=\"What Happens after We Die?\" data-video-description=\"Life after death is part of God’s plan of happiness.\" data-video-id=\"5454775877001\" data-ip=\"Download and Streaming                            \" data-duration=\"100000\" data-assetId=\"57e612931ed5b6808e629064dc09ea391e980cb6\" data-ref-id=\"57e612931ed5b6808e629064dc09ea391e980cb6\" data-duration-string=\"1:40\" id=\"video6\"><source src=\"https://mediasrv.churchofjesuschrist.org/vod/stream/1241706627001/5454775877001.m3u8\" type=\"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"9317659\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/57e612931ed5b6808e629064dc09ea391e980cb6-360p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-file-size=\"5468152\"/><source src=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/57e612931ed5b6808e629064dc09ea391e980cb6-720p-en.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-file-size=\"9317659\"/></video><figcaption><header><p class=\"title\">What Happens after We Die?</p></header></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_gLWRV\">\n<img alt=\"discipel raakt de handen van Christus aan\" id=\"img_t3bJe\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21500%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"bib6f6mo6408r7os0l8l09w4fyvg6wl2x6t60yel\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"500\" data-height=\"281\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1.7793594306049823\" data-public-title=\"Behold My Hand\" data-public-description=\"Two Apostles looking at the wounds in Jesus' hand and wrist.\"/>\n<figcaption>\n<p data-aid=\"170146904\" id=\"p_dkfO0\"><cite>Zie mijn handen</cite>, Jeff Ward</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_u6Luy\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170146923\" id=\"p_xaCJ0\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p24-p29#p24\">Johannes 20:24–29</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170146942\" id=\"p_kICm4\">Ik kan in Jezus Christus geloven, ook al zie ik Hem niet.</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146961\" id=\"p_pa9cX\">Je kunt je kinderen het bovenstaande schilderij laten zien terwijl jullie <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p24-p29#p24\">Johannes 20:24–29</span> lezen. Ze kunnen zinsneden uit deze verzen kiezen die een goede titel voor het schilderij zijn. Om je kinderen te helpen de woorden van <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/20.html?id=p29#p29\">Johannes 20:29</span> uit het hoofd te leren, kun je die op aparte strookjes papier schrijven. Vervolgens kunnen je kinderen proberen de woorden in de juiste volgorde te zetten.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170146980\" id=\"p_xrOFk\">Om het beginsel dat Jezus Thomas leerde kracht bij te zetten, kun je iets in een doos verstoppen en getuigen dat het er echt is. Vraag je kinderen of ze dat geloven en waarom. Dit kan leiden tot een gesprek over dingen die ze geloven, ook als ze die niet zien. Vertel elkaar waarom je in Jezus Christus gelooft, ook al kun je Hem niet zien.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_g8oNZ\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170147016\" id=\"p_fqNz7\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p35#p13\">Lukas 24:13–35</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170147034\" id=\"p_yN6rM\">Jezus zal me zijn invloed in mijn leven laten zien.</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170147055\" id=\"p_rDfHH\">Terwijl jij en je kinderen <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/24.html?id=p13-p35#p13\">Lukas 24:13–35</span> lezen, kun je ze vragen om op dingen te letten waardoor de twee discipelen Jezus konden herkennen. (Zie ook ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/47-jesus-comforts-two-disciples?lang=nld\">Jesus Comforts Two Disciples</a>’ [Jezus troost twee discipelen], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].) Bespreek vervolgens met elkaar hoe jullie zijn invloed in je leven herkennen.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sec_y5QU0\">\n<header>\n<p class=\"scripture-title\" data-aid=\"170147097\" id=\"p_yXF4n\"><span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/21.html?id=p15-p17#p15\">Johannes 21:15–17</span></p>\n<h3 data-aid=\"170147118\" id=\"p_wmcnl\">Ik kan mijn liefde voor Jezus tonen door zijn schapen te weiden.</h3>\n</header>\n<ul class=\"bullet\">\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170147139\" id=\"p_nxtFO\">Lees eventueel <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/21.html?id=p15-p17#p15\">Johannes 21:15–17</span> terwijl jullie samen eten. (Zie ook ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/manual/new-testament-scripture-stories/48-feed-his-sheep?lang=nld\">Feed My Sheep</a>’ [Weid Mijn schapen], in <cite>New Testament Stories</cite> [Verhalen uit het Nieuwe Testament].) Dat kan de woorden ‘weid Mijn schapen’ van de Heiland kracht bijzetten. Jullie kunnen ook andere Schriftteksten opzoeken waarin Jezus over schapen sprak, zoals <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/9.html?id=p35-p36#p35\">Mattheüs 9:35–36</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/10.html?id=p5-p6#p5\">10:5–6</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/matt/25.html?id=p31-p46#p31\">25:31–46</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/luke/15.html?id=p4-p7#p4\">Lukas 15:4–7</span>; <span class=\"legacy-scripture-ref\" data-legacy-href=\"../../scriptures/nt/john/10.html?id=p1-p16#p1\">Johannes 10:1–16</span>. Waarom is schapen weiden een goede manier om het dienen van Gods kinderen te beschrijven?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-aid=\"170147161\" id=\"p_boJf6\">Vertel je kinderen het verhaal over Peyton in de toespraak van presidente Bonnie H. Cordon ‘<a class=\"cross-ref\" href=\"/study/general-conference/2021/10/13cordon?lang=nld&amp;id=p28-p30#p28\">Kom tot Christus en kom niet alleen</a>’ (<cite>Liahona</cite>, november 2021, 12). Dit kan ze inspireren om te bedenken hoe ze anderen kunnen helpen om tot Christus te komen. Hoe kunnen we dat bijvoorbeeld doen met de mensen die we op zondag in de kerk zien?</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resources\">\n<figure class=\"handout no-print\" id=\"fig_qjfgk\">\n<figure class=\"image no-print\" id=\"fig_oTVRY\">\n<img alt=\"Christus en Maria bij het graf\" data-scale=\"700\" id=\"img_c0HSo\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21320%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"5ed72945bf12aa0f34f24e95c25145ec5daf0c0f\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"320\" data-height=\"426\" data-aspect-ratio=\"0.7511737089201878\" data-public-title=\"Why weepest thou\" data-public-description=\"The scripture from John 20:15-16 is depicted where the resurrected Christ asks Mary Magdalene &quot;Why weepest thou?&quot;\"/>\n<div class=\"credit\">\n<p data-aid=\"170147226\" id=\"p_zgaBF\">Met toestemming gebruikt. <cite>Waarom huilt u</cite>, Simon Dewey. Met dank aan <span class=\"language\" lang=\"eng\">altusfineart.com</span> © 2025.</p>\n</div>\n</figure>\n<a href=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/58/z6/58z6skjei7j0bnts7ricpr9h9b89kt2kf33opic0/2027_come_follow_me_for_home_and_church_new_testament.pdf\">\n<img alt=\"doe-pagina: Omdat Jezus is opgestaan, zal ik ook uit de dood opstaan\" data-scale=\"800\" id=\"img_dTu0A\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21320%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"58z6skjei7j0bnts7ricpr9h9b89kt2kf33opic0\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"f23r75lwe7a5c1en5vj15zx4q6t278vkq8dqyx8p\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"320\" data-height=\"415\" data-aspect-ratio=\"0.7710843373493976\"/>\n</a><a h